  "benefits": "\n  - **Free Seed Distribution:** Seed packets containing seeds of bottle gourd, ladyfinger, beans, bitter gourd, ridge gourd, spinach, and cowpea worth ₹50/- are provided free of cost to eligible beneficiaries.\n<br>\n\n",
